   374	0, 1, . . . , K, define ck as the objective function vector with coefficients cki :=
   375	bci /2K−k c, i = 1, 2, . . . , n. The algorithm works in phases. In phase k, it solves
   376	the optimization problem for ck . A detailed description is provided below. As
