   127	strongly polynomial algorithms to solve the inverse min-max spanning tree and the inverse
   128	maximum capacity path problems when bounds are also given on the coordinates of the deviation
   129	vector. Lasserre [17] considered the inverse optimization problem associated with the polynomial
   130	program and a given current feasible solution, and provided a systematic numerical scheme to
   131	compute an inverse optimal solution. Ahmadian, Bhaskar, Sanità, and Swamy [1] studied
   132	integral inverse optimization problems from an approximation point of view. They obtained
