   134	some of their results apply for ℓ∞ -norm as well. Zhang, Guan, and Zhang [28] provided a
   135	mathematical model of the inverse spanning tree problem, gave a characterization of optimal
   136	solutions, and developed a strongly polynomial algorithm for determining an optimal deviation
   137	vector. Recently, the authors [4] introduced inverse optimization problems with multiple cost
   138	functions, and studied the inverse minimum-cost s-t path, r-arborescence, and bipartite perfect
