     7	Solution methods for partial inverse combinatorial
     8	optimization problems in which weights can only be
     9	increased
    10	
    11	Eva Ley1       · Maximilian Merkert1
    12	
    13	Received: 8 February 2024 / Accepted: 26 July 2025 / Published online: 27 August 2025
    14	© The Author(s) 2025
